<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Fudosan sees Oriental Land minimum bid.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Fudosan sees Oriental Land minimum bid.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Fudosan Co Ltd said on Thursday that it expected the minimum bid price for shares in Oriental Land Co Ltd to be auctioned in November at 5,260 yen per share.</p>
<p>The company said that it expects to raise special profits of 27.6 billion yen stemming from the sale of 5.5 million shares it owns in Oriental Land, the operator of Tokyo Disneyland, based on the expected minimum bid of 5,260 yen.</p>
</text>
